ission. Upgrades increase the clutch's ability to handle the extra torque of a racing engine without damage.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/clutch_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/clutch_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":3888000,"tier":"Stock Clutch","level":0,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"clutch_in_time":0.01,"clutch_out_time":0.01},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/stock_LG_Icon.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Transmission","label":"Transmission","desc":"The transmission transmits you car's power from the engine to the drive wheels. Transmission upgrades can make shifts quicker and more efficient, reduce friction and power loss, and provide better durability. These upgrades also make an audible difference.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/transmission_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/transmission_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":3888000,"tier":"Race Transmission","level":3,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"moment_inertia":0.0118,"gear_shift_time":0.1,"final_drive_ratio":3.4,"num_gears":2,"gear_ratio0":-2,"gear_ratio1":2},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/transmission_LG_3.webp"}],"stockIdx":0},{"slot":"Driveline","label":"Driveline","desc":"You can improve throttle response and acceleration by decreasing the weight and inertia of driveline components, especially the driveshaft itself.","icon":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/driveline_Icon.webp","emblem":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/driveline_LG_Icon.webp","opts":[{"id":3888000,"tier":"Sport Driveline","level":2,"price":0,"isStock":true,"mfr":null,"stats":{"moment_inertia":0.0255,"flex_max_angle":720,"flex_spring_min":1500,"flex_spring_max":10000,"flex_damper_min":0.2,"flex_damper_max":0.2,"flex_damper_min_offroad":0.4,"flex_damper_max_offroad":0.4,"flex_spring_min_wheel_torque":20,"flex_spring_max_wheel_torque":1500},"img":"/brand-assets/upgrades/icons/Drivetrain/driveline_L